msgctxt "parser.tooLarge"
msgid "Crawlers stop reading this file after the first 500 KiB, so every rule after that point is ignored. The file is {kib} KiB."
msgstr "Il-crawlers jieqfu jaqraw dan il-fajl wara l-ewwel 500 KiB, għalhekk kull regola wara dak il-punt tiġi injorata. Il-fajl huwa ta’ {kib} KiB."

msgctxt "parser.bom"
msgid "A crawler with a strict parser may misread the first line, because the file starts with a UTF-8 byte-order mark. Save the file without one."
msgstr "Crawler b’parser strett jista’ jaqra ħażin l-ewwel linja, għax il-fajl jibda b’byte-order mark tal-UTF-8. Issejvja l-fajl mingħajru."

msgctxt "parser.notFieldValue"
msgid "Crawlers ignore this line, because it is not written as \"directive: value\"."
msgstr "Il-crawlers jinjoraw din il-linja, għax mhijiex miktuba bħala “direttiva: valur”."

msgctxt "parser.misspelling"
msgid "Crawlers other than Google may skip this line, because \"{raw}\" is a misspelling of \"{field}\". Google reads it as \"{field}\"."
msgstr "Crawlers li mhumiex ta’ Google jistgħu jaqbżu din il-linja, għax “{raw}” hija kitba ħażina ta’ “{field}”. Google jaqraha bħala “{field}”."

msgctxt "parser.emptyUserAgent"
msgid "The rules under this line apply to no crawler, because the User-agent line names none."
msgstr "Ir-regoli taħt din il-linja ma japplikaw għall-ebda crawler, għax il-linja User-agent ma ssemmi l-ebda wieħed."

msgctxt "parser.emptyUserAgent.others"
msgid "This line adds no crawler to the group, because the User-agent value is empty. The rules under it apply to {names}."
msgstr "Din il-linja ma żżid l-ebda crawler mal-grupp, għax il-valur ta’ User-agent huwa vojt. Ir-regoli ta’ taħtha japplikaw għal {names}."

msgctxt "parser.emptyUserAgent.star"
msgid "This line adds no crawler to the group, because the User-agent value is empty. The rules under it apply to every crawler without its own rules."
msgstr "Din il-linja ma żżid l-ebda crawler mal-grupp, għax il-valur ta’ User-agent huwa vojt. Ir-regoli ta’ taħtha japplikaw għal kull crawler li m’għandux regoli tiegħu."

msgctxt "parser.invalidToken"
msgid "The rules under this line apply to no crawler, because \"{value}\" is not a valid crawler name."
msgstr "Ir-regoli taħt din il-linja ma japplikaw għall-ebda crawler, għax “{value}” mhuwiex isem validu ta’ crawler."

msgctxt "parser.invalidToken.others"
msgid "This line adds no crawler to the group, because \"{value}\" is not a valid crawler name. The rules under it apply to {names}."
msgstr "Din il-linja ma żżid l-ebda crawler mal-grupp, għax “{value}” mhuwiex isem validu ta’ crawler. Ir-regoli ta’ taħtha japplikaw għal {names}."

msgctxt "parser.invalidToken.star"
msgid "This line adds no crawler to the group, because \"{value}\" is not a valid crawler name. The rules under it apply to every crawler without its own rules."
msgstr "Din il-linja ma żżid l-ebda crawler mal-grupp, għax “{value}” mhuwiex isem validu ta’ crawler. Ir-regoli ta’ taħtha japplikaw għal kull crawler li m’għandux regoli tiegħu."

msgctxt "parser.tokenTail"
msgid "These rules apply to \"{token}\", not to \"{value}\". Crawlers read only the name and ignore what follows it."
msgstr "Dawn ir-regoli japplikaw għal “{token}”, mhux għal “{value}”. Il-crawlers jaqraw l-isem biss u jinjoraw dak li jiġi warajh."

msgctxt "parser.ruleBeforeAgent"
msgid "Crawlers ignore this {directive} line, because it comes before any User-agent line."
msgstr "Il-crawlers jinjoraw din il-linja {directive}, għax tinsab qabel kwalunkwe linja User-agent."

msgctxt "parser.ruleBeforeAgent.disallow"
msgid "{outcome} This line was meant to block it, but it comes before any User-agent line, so crawlers ignore it."
msgstr "{outcome} Din il-linja kellha timblokka dak l-indirizz, iżda tinsab qabel kwalunkwe linja User-agent, għalhekk il-crawlers jinjorawha."

msgctxt "parser.ruleBeforeAgent.allow"
msgid "{outcome} This line was meant to open it, but it comes before any User-agent line, so crawlers ignore it."
msgstr "{outcome} Din il-linja kellha tiftaħ dak l-indirizz, iżda tinsab qabel kwalunkwe linja User-agent, għalhekk il-crawlers jinjorawha."

msgctxt "parser.emptyAllow"
msgid "This line changes nothing, because an Allow without a path matches no URL."
msgstr "Din il-linja ma tibdel xejn, għax Allow mingħajr mogħdija ma taqbel mal-ebda URL."

msgctxt "parser.emptyDisallow"
msgid "This line blocks nothing, because a Disallow without a path leaves every URL open."
msgstr "Din il-linja ma timblokka xejn, għax Disallow mingħajr mogħdija tħalli kull URL miftuħ."

msgctxt "parser.pathNoSlash.disallow"
msgid "{outcome} This line was meant to block it, but \"{value}\" does not start with \"/\", so it matches no URL. Write \"/{value}\"."
msgstr "{outcome} Din il-linja kellha timblokka dak l-indirizz, iżda “{value}” ma jibdiex b’“/”, għalhekk ma taqbel mal-ebda URL. Ikteb “/{value}”."

msgctxt "parser.pathNoSlash.allow"
msgid "{outcome} This line was meant to open it, but \"{value}\" does not start with \"/\", so it matches no URL. Write \"/{value}\"."
msgstr "{outcome} Din il-linja kellha tiftaħ dak l-indirizz, iżda “{value}” ma jibdiex b’“/”, għalhekk ma taqbel mal-ebda URL. Ikteb “/{value}”."

msgctxt "parser.crawlDelayBeforeAgent"
msgid "No crawler slows down for this Crawl-delay line, because it comes before any User-agent line and is ignored."
msgstr "L-ebda crawler ma jimxi aktar bil-mod minħabba din il-linja Crawl-delay, għax tinsab qabel kwalunkwe linja User-agent u tiġi injorata."

msgctxt "parser.crawlDelayNaN"
msgid "No crawler slows down for this line, because \"{value}\" is not a number."
msgstr "L-ebda crawler ma jimxi aktar bil-mod minħabba din il-linja, għax “{value}” mhuwiex numru."

msgctxt "parser.crawlDelayDuplicate"
msgid "Crawlers ignore this Crawl-delay, because the group already has one and the first one is kept."
msgstr "Il-crawlers jinjoraw din il-linja Crawl-delay, għax il-grupp diġà għandu waħda u tinżamm l-ewwel waħda."

msgctxt "parser.crawlDelayNonStandard"
msgid "Only Bing slows down for Crawl-delay. Google and Yandex ignore it, because it is not part of RFC 9309."
msgstr "Bing biss jimxi aktar bil-mod minħabba Crawl-delay. Google u Yandex jinjorawha, għax mhijiex parti mill-RFC 9309."

msgctxt "parser.sitemapInvalid"
msgid "Crawlers cannot find this sitemap, because \"{value}\" is not a full address that starts with http:// or https://."
msgstr "Il-crawlers ma jistgħux isibu dan is-sitemap, għax “{value}” mhuwiex indirizz sħiħ li jibda b’http:// jew https://."

msgctxt "parser.hostDuplicate"
msgid "This Host line is ignored, because the file already has one and the first one is kept."
msgstr "Din il-linja Host tiġi injorata, għax il-fajl diġà għandu waħda u tinżamm l-ewwel waħda."

msgctxt "parser.hostObsolete"
msgid "No crawler reads this Host line. Host was a Yandex-only directive for naming the main mirror, and Yandex dropped it in 2018. Redirect to the preferred hostname instead."
msgstr "L-ebda crawler ma jaqra din il-linja Host. Host kienet direttiva ta’ Yandex biss, biex jissemma l-mirror ewlieni, u Yandex neħħieha fl-2018. Minflok, irridirieġi lejn il-hostname preferut."

msgctxt "parser.cleanParamMalformed"
msgid "Yandex ignores this Clean-param line, because it is malformed. Write \"Clean-param: p1&p2 /path-prefix\", with parameter names made of letters, digits, \"_\", \"-\" and \".\"."
msgstr "Yandex jinjora din il-linja Clean-param, għax mhijiex miktuba sew. Ikteb “Clean-param: p1&p2 /prefiss-tal-mogħdija”, b’ismijiet ta’ parametri magħmula minn ittri, ċifri, “_”, “-” u “.”."

msgctxt "parser.cleanParamTooLong"
msgid "Yandex ignores this Clean-param line, because it is longer than the {max} characters Yandex accepts."
msgstr "Yandex jinjora din il-linja Clean-param, għax hija itwal minn {max} karattru, il-limitu li jaċċetta Yandex."

msgctxt "parser.cleanParamInfo"
msgid "Only Yandex follows this line: it leaves out the listed query parameters when it crawls. Every other crawler ignores Clean-param."
msgstr "Yandex biss isegwi din il-linja: waqt il-crawling iħalli barra l-parametri tal-query elenkati. Kull crawler ieħor jinjora Clean-param."

msgctxt "parser.noindex"
msgid "This line keeps no page out of search results, because no major search engine supports Noindex in robots.txt. Use a robots meta tag or the X-Robots-Tag header instead."
msgstr "Din il-linja ma żżomm l-ebda paġna barra mir-riżultati tat-tiftix, għax l-ebda magna tat-tiftix ewlenija ma tappoġġja Noindex f’robots.txt. Minflok, uża robots meta tag jew il-header X-Robots-Tag."

msgctxt "parser.unknownDirective"
msgid "Crawlers ignore this line, because \"{field}\" is not a directive they know."
msgstr "Il-crawlers jinjoraw din il-linja, għax “{field}” mhijiex direttiva li jafu."

msgctxt "parser.noRules"
msgid "Every crawler may read every page, because the file holds no rules."
msgstr "Kull crawler jista’ jaqra kull paġna, għax il-fajl m’għandu l-ebda regola."

msgctxt "parser.emptyGroup"
msgid "The crawlers this group names may read every page, because the group has no rules."
msgstr "Il-crawlers li jsemmi dan il-grupp jistgħu jaqraw kull paġna, għax il-grupp m’għandu l-ebda regola."

msgctxt "parser.emptyGroup.merged"
msgid "This group adds no rules. The crawlers it names follow the rules of their other groups in this file."
msgstr "Dan il-grupp ma jżid l-ebda regola. Il-crawlers li jsemmi jsegwu r-regoli tal-gruppi l-oħra tagħhom f’dan il-fajl."

msgctxt "parser.tokenRepeated"
msgid "Older crawlers may follow only part of the rules for \"{token}\", because the name appears in {n} groups. RFC 9309 merges the groups, but older crawlers may use only the first."
msgstr "Crawlers eqdem jistgħu jsegwu biss parti mir-regoli għal “{token}”, għax l-isem jidher f’aktar minn grupp wieħed ({n}). L-RFC 9309 jgħaqqad il-gruppi, iżda crawlers eqdem jistgħu jużaw l-ewwel wieħed biss."

msgctxt "parser.starBlocksAll"
msgid "The whole site is blocked for every crawler without its own group, because the \"*\" group disallows it."
msgstr "Is-sit kollu huwa imblukkat għal kull crawler li m’għandux grupp tiegħu, għax il-grupp “*” jipprojbixxih."

msgctxt "parser.noSitemap"
msgid "Crawlers have to find new pages by following links, because the file lists no sitemap. A Sitemap line is optional, but it helps them."
msgstr "Il-crawlers ikollhom isibu l-paġni l-ġodda billi jsegwu l-links, għax il-fajl ma jelenka l-ebda sitemap. Linja Sitemap mhijiex obbligatorja, iżda tgħinhom."

msgctxt "seo.trailingSlash.allow"
msgid "URLs such as {path}s, {path}-old and {path}2 are open too, because \"{path}\" is a prefix and matches every URL that starts with it. Write \"{path}/\" for the directory, or \"{path}$\" for only that URL."
msgstr "URLs bħal {path}s, {path}-old u {path}2 huma miftuħin ukoll, għax “{path}” huwa prefiss u jaqbel ma’ kull URL li jibda bih. Ikteb “{path}/” għad-direttorju, jew “{path}$” għal dak il-URL biss."

msgctxt "seo.trailingSlash.disallow"
msgid "URLs such as {path}s, {path}-old and {path}2 are blocked too, because \"{path}\" is a prefix and matches every URL that starts with it. Write \"{path}/\" for the directory, or \"{path}$\" for only that URL."
msgstr "URLs bħal {path}s, {path}-old u {path}2 huma imblukkati wkoll, għax “{path}” huwa prefiss u jaqbel ma’ kull URL li jibda bih. Ikteb “{path}/” għad-direttorju, jew “{path}$” għal dak il-URL biss."

msgctxt "seo.selfBlock"
msgid "Crawlers other than Google may stop reading your rules altogether, because \"Disallow: {path}\" also matches /robots.txt. Google fetches robots.txt regardless."
msgstr "Crawlers li mhumiex ta’ Google jistgħu jieqfu jaqraw ir-regoli tiegħek għalkollox, għax “Disallow: {path}” taqbel ukoll ma’ /robots.txt. Google iniżżel robots.txt xorta waħda."

msgctxt "seo.caseSensitive"
msgid "{outcome} This line covers only URLs written exactly as \"{path}\", because paths are case-sensitive. Check the casing of the site's real URLs."
msgstr "{outcome} Din il-linja tkopri biss URLs miktuba eżatt bħal “{path}”, għax il-mogħdijiet jagħmlu differenza bejn ittri kbar u żgħar. Iċċekkja kif inhuma miktuba l-URLs veri tas-sit."

msgctxt "seo.duplicate"
msgid "This line changes nothing, because \"{rule}\" repeats line {line}{scope}."
msgstr "Din il-linja ma tibdel xejn, għax “{rule}” tirrepeti l-linja {line}{scope}."

msgctxt "seo.redundant"
msgid "This line changes nothing, because every URL \"{rule}\" matches is already covered by \"{winner}\" on line {line}{scope}."
msgstr "Din il-linja ma tibdel xejn, għax kull URL li taqbel miegħu “{rule}” huwa diġà kopert minn “{winner}” fil-linja {line}{scope}."

msgctxt "seo.overridden.disallow"
msgid "{path} stays open, because \"{winner}\" on line {line} wins over \"{rule}\" on every URL it matches{scope}."
msgstr "L-indirizz {path} jibqa’ miftuħ, għax “{winner}” fil-linja {line} tirbaħ fuq “{rule}” f’kull URL li taqbel miegħu{scope}."

msgctxt "seo.overridden.allow"
msgid "{path} stays blocked, because \"{winner}\" on line {line} wins over \"{rule}\" on every URL it matches{scope}."
msgstr "L-indirizz {path} jibqa’ imblukkat, għax “{winner}” fil-linja {line} tirbaħ fuq “{rule}” f’kull URL li taqbel miegħu{scope}."

msgctxt "seo.mergedScope"
msgid " (rules for \"{token}\" are merged across groups)"
msgstr " (ir-regoli għal “{token}” jingħaqdu minn gruppi differenti)"

msgctxt "outcome.open.all"
msgid "{path} is open to every crawler."
msgstr "L-indirizz {path} huwa miftuħ għal kull crawler."

msgctxt "outcome.open.default"
msgid "{path} is open to every crawler without its own rules in this file."
msgstr "L-indirizz {path} huwa miftuħ għal kull crawler li m’għandux regoli tiegħu f’dan il-fajl."

msgctxt "outcome.open.named"
msgid "{path} is open to {names}."
msgstr "L-indirizz {path} huwa miftuħ għal {names}."

msgctxt "outcome.allowed.all"
msgid "{path} is open to every crawler, because \"{winner}\" on line {line} allows it."
msgstr "L-indirizz {path} huwa miftuħ għal kull crawler, għax “{winner}” fil-linja {line} tippermettih."

msgctxt "outcome.allowed.default"
msgid "{path} is open to every crawler without its own rules in this file, because \"{winner}\" on line {line} allows it."
msgstr "L-indirizz {path} huwa miftuħ għal kull crawler li m’għandux regoli tiegħu f’dan il-fajl, għax “{winner}” fil-linja {line} tippermettih."

msgctxt "outcome.allowed.named"
msgid "{path} is open to {names}, because \"{winner}\" on line {line} allows it."
msgstr "L-indirizz {path} huwa miftuħ għal {names}, għax “{winner}” fil-linja {line} tippermettih."

msgctxt "outcome.blocked.all"
msgid "{path} is blocked for every crawler, by \"{winner}\" on line {line}."
msgstr "L-indirizz {path} huwa imblukkat għal kull crawler, minn “{winner}” fil-linja {line}."

msgctxt "outcome.blocked.default"
msgid "{path} is blocked for every crawler without its own rules in this file, by \"{winner}\" on line {line}."
msgstr "L-indirizz {path} huwa imblukkat għal kull crawler li m’għandux regoli tiegħu f’dan il-fajl, minn “{winner}” fil-linja {line}."

msgctxt "outcome.blocked.named"
msgid "{path} is blocked for {names}, by \"{winner}\" on line {line}."
msgstr "L-indirizz {path} huwa imblukkat għal {names}, minn “{winner}” fil-linja {line}."

msgctxt "outcome.names.more"
msgid "{names} and {n} more"
msgstr "{names} u {n} oħra"

msgctxt "sitemap.duplicate"
msgid "This line adds nothing, because the same sitemap is already listed on line {line}."
msgstr "Din il-linja ma żżid xejn, għax l-istess sitemap huwa diġà elenkat fil-linja {line}."

msgctxt "sitemap.protocolMismatch"
msgid "Crawlers hit a redirect or an insecure copy every time they fetch this sitemap, because the site is served over https and the sitemap is listed as http. Use {url}."
msgstr "Il-crawlers isibu ridirezzjoni jew kopja mhux sigura kull darba li jniżżlu dan is-sitemap, għax is-sit jingħata fuq https u s-sitemap huwa elenkat bħala http. Uża {url}."

msgctxt "sitemap.httpsOnHttp"
msgid "Crawlers fetch this sitemap over https, while the site was reached over http. This is fine if the site redirects to https; otherwise list the sitemap with the protocol the site uses."
msgstr "Il-crawlers iniżżlu dan is-sitemap fuq https, filwaqt li s-sit intlaħaq fuq http. Dan tajjeb jekk is-sit jirridirieġi lejn https; inkella elenka s-sitemap bil-protokoll li juża s-sit."

msgctxt "sitemap.crossDomain"
msgid "Search engines may ignore this sitemap, because it is hosted on {host} and not on {site}. Google accepts it only when both sites are verified by the same owner in Search Console (cross-site submission)."
msgstr "Il-magni tat-tiftix jistgħu jinjoraw dan is-sitemap, għax jinsab fuq {host} u mhux fuq {site}. Google jaċċettah biss meta ż-żewġ siti jkunu vverifikati mill-istess sid f’Search Console (sottomissjoni bejn siti differenti)."

msgctxt "sitemap.otherSubdomain"
msgid "Crawlers accept this sitemap. It sits on another host of the same domain ({host}), and listing it here is what allows it to contain {site} URLs."
msgstr "Il-crawlers jaċċettaw dan is-sitemap. Jinsab fuq host ieħor tal-istess dominju ({host}), u huwa għax elenkajtu hawn li jista’ jkun fih URLs ta’ {site}."

msgctxt "lint.absoluteUrl"
msgid "\"{rule}\" matches no URL, because a rule must be a path and this is a full address. The line also publishes the hostname."
msgstr "“{rule}” ma taqbel mal-ebda URL, għax regola trid tkun mogħdija u dan huwa indirizz sħiħ. Barra minn hekk, il-linja tippubblika l-hostname."

msgctxt "lint.absoluteUrl.disallow"
msgid "{outcome} This line was meant to block it, but \"{rule}\" is a full address and a rule must be a path, so it matches no URL. Write \"{path}\". The line also publishes the hostname."
msgstr "{outcome} Din il-linja kellha timblokka dak l-indirizz, iżda “{rule}” huwa indirizz sħiħ u regola trid tkun mogħdija, għalhekk ma taqbel mal-ebda URL. Ikteb “{path}”. Barra minn hekk, il-linja tippubblika l-hostname."

msgctxt "lint.absoluteUrl.allow"
msgid "{outcome} This line was meant to open it, but \"{rule}\" is a full address and a rule must be a path, so it matches no URL. Write \"{path}\". The line also publishes the hostname."
msgstr "{outcome} Din il-linja kellha tiftaħ dak l-indirizz, iżda “{rule}” huwa indirizz sħiħ u regola trid tkun mogħdija, għalhekk ma taqbel mal-ebda URL. Ikteb “{path}”. Barra minn hekk, il-linja tippubblika l-hostname."

msgctxt "fetch.warn.redirectLimit"
msgid "Google treats this site as having no robots.txt, so no page is restricted. The file sits behind more than five redirects, and RFC 9309 lets crawlers give up at that point."
msgstr "Google jittratta dan is-sit bħallikieku m’għandux robots.txt, għalhekk l-ebda paġna mhi ristretta. Il-fajl jinsab wara aktar minn ħames ridirezzjonijiet, u l-RFC 9309 jippermetti lill-crawlers jieqfu f’dak il-punt."

msgctxt "fetch.warn.redirectSameSite"
msgid "Crawlers still reach the file. robots.txt redirects to {host}, and crawlers follow a www or https redirect like this one."
msgstr "Il-crawlers xorta jaslu sal-fajl. robots.txt jirridirieġi lejn {host}, u l-crawlers isegwu ridirezzjoni www jew https bħal din."

msgctxt "fetch.warn.redirectOtherHost"
msgid "{from} is governed by the rules of {to}, because robots.txt redirects to that host and crawlers apply the file they land on."
msgstr "{from} jaqa’ taħt ir-regoli ta’ {to}, għax robots.txt jirridirieġi lejn dak il-host u l-crawlers japplikaw il-fajl li jaslu fih."

msgctxt "fetch.warn.notRobotsPath"
msgid "Crawlers read the content of {path} as your robots.txt, because the redirect ended there and not at /robots.txt."
msgstr "Il-crawlers jaqraw il-kontenut ta’ {path} bħala r-robots.txt tiegħek, għax ir-ridirezzjoni ntemmet hemm u mhux f’/robots.txt."

msgctxt "fetch.error.empty"
msgid "Enter a website URL."
msgstr "Daħħal il-URL ta’ sit web."

msgctxt "fetch.error.invalidUrl"
msgid "\"{input}\" is not a valid URL."
msgstr "“{input}” mhuwiex URL validu."

msgctxt "fetch.error.unsupportedProtocol"
msgid "Only http and https URLs are supported."
msgstr "URLs http u https biss huma appoġġjati."

msgctxt "fetch.error.notHostname"
msgid "\"{host}\" does not look like a hostname."
msgstr "“{host}” ma jidhirx li huwa hostname."

msgctxt "fetch.error.directTimeout"
msgid "Direct fetch timed out."
msgstr "It-tniżżil dirett ħa wisq ħin."

msgctxt "fetch.error.cors"
msgid "Direct fetch was blocked. The site does not send CORS headers for robots.txt."
msgstr "It-tniżżil dirett ġie imblukkat. Is-sit ma jibgħatx headers CORS għar-robots.txt."

msgctxt "fetch.error.noProxy"
msgid "The proxy is not configured. Set WORKER_URL in js/config.js."
msgstr "Il-proxy mhuwiex ikkonfigurat. Issettja WORKER_URL f’js/config.js."

msgctxt "fetch.error.proxyTimeout"
msgid "The proxy did not answer in time."
msgstr "Il-proxy ma weġibx fil-ħin."

msgctxt "fetch.error.proxyUnreachable"
msgid "Could not reach the proxy."
msgstr "Il-proxy ma setax jintlaħaq."

msgctxt "fetch.error.proxyUnreadable"
msgid "The proxy returned an unreadable response (HTTP {status})."
msgstr "Il-proxy bagħat tweġiba li ma tistax tinqara (HTTP {status})."

msgctxt "fetch.error.rateLimited"
msgid "Too many requests: the proxy is rate-limited right now. Wait a minute and try again."
msgstr "Wisq talbiet: bħalissa l-proxy qed jillimita r-rata. Stenna minuta u erġa’ pprova."

msgctxt "fetch.error.paused"
msgid "The proxy is switched off at the moment, so only sites that send CORS headers can be fetched. Paste the robots.txt instead."
msgstr "Bħalissa l-proxy huwa mitfi, għalhekk jistgħu jitniżżlu biss siti li jibagħtu headers CORS. Minflok, waħħal ir-robots.txt."

msgctxt "fetch.error.originRefused"
msgid "The proxy refused this page's origin. Add it to ALLOWED_ORIGINS in worker/wrangler.toml."
msgstr "Il-proxy rrifjuta l-oriġini ta’ din il-paġna. Żidha ma’ ALLOWED_ORIGINS f’worker/wrangler.toml."

msgctxt "fetch.error.proxy"
msgid "Proxy error (HTTP {status}). {detail}"
msgstr "Żball tal-proxy (HTTP {status}). {detail}"

msgctxt "fetch.error.noProxyFallback"
msgid "{reason} No proxy is configured, so the file cannot be read. Paste its contents instead."
msgstr "{reason} M’hemm l-ebda proxy ikkonfigurat, għalhekk il-fajl ma jistax jinqara. Minflok, waħħal il-kontenut tiegħu."

msgctxt "fetch.error.couldNotFetch"
msgid "Could not fetch {url}. {reason}"
msgstr "{url} ma setax jitniżżel. {reason}"

msgctxt "security.reconWarning"
msgid "Attackers read the Disallow lines of this file to decide where to look first, because robots.txt is public and is not access control. Protect every path listed here with authentication, remove it from the web root, or mark it noindex with an HTTP header."
msgstr "L-attakkanti jaqraw il-linji Disallow ta’ dan il-fajl biex jiddeċiedu fejn ifittxu l-ewwel, għax robots.txt huwa pubbliku u mhuwiex kontroll tal-aċċess. Ipproteġi kull mogħdija elenkata hawn b’awtentikazzjoni, neħħiha mill-web root, jew immarkaha noindex b’header HTTP."

msgctxt "security.category.admin.label"
msgid "Admin / internal"
msgstr "Admin / intern"

msgctxt "security.category.admin.advice"
msgid "Protect with authentication and send an X-Robots-Tag: noindex header. Listing it here only advertises where the login is."
msgstr "Ipproteġi b’awtentikazzjoni u ibgħat header X-Robots-Tag: noindex. Li telenkah hawn juri biss fejn qiegħed il-login."

msgctxt "security.category.staging.label"
msgid "Staging / dev"
msgstr "Staging / żvilupp"

msgctxt "security.category.staging.advice"
msgid "Take staging and test environments off the public internet, or restrict them by IP or login. Use a noindex header rather than robots.txt."
msgstr "Neħħi l-ambjenti ta’ staging u tal-ittestjar mill-internet pubbliku, jew illimitahom b’IP jew b’login. Uża header noindex minflok robots.txt."

msgctxt "security.category.backups.label"
msgid "Backups & archives"
msgstr "Backups u arkivji"

msgctxt "security.category.backups.advice"
msgid "Backups and archives should not be reachable over HTTP at all. Move them outside the web root and verify the URL returns 404."
msgstr "Il-backups u l-arkivji m’għandhom ikunu aċċessibbli b’HTTP bl-ebda mod. Mexxihom barra mill-web root u vverifika li l-URL jagħti 404."

msgctxt "security.category.secrets.label"
msgid "Secrets & config"
msgstr "Sigrieti u konfigurazzjoni"

msgctxt "security.category.secrets.advice"
msgid "Configuration files, version-control folders and credentials must never be web-accessible. Block them at the server and check they return 403 or 404."
msgstr "Fajls ta’ konfigurazzjoni, folders tal-kontroll tal-verżjonijiet u kredenzjali qatt m’għandhom ikunu aċċessibbli mill-web. Imblukkahom fis-server u ċċekkja li jagħtu 403 jew 404."

msgctxt "security.category.api.label"
msgid "Private APIs & debug"
msgstr "APIs privati u debug"

msgctxt "security.category.api.advice"
msgid "Internal APIs and debug endpoints need authentication or a network allowlist. Crawlers are not the threat here; scripted scanners are."
msgstr "L-APIs interni u l-endpoints tad-debug jeħtieġu awtentikazzjoni jew allowlist tan-netwerk. Hawnhekk it-theddida mhumiex il-crawlers, iżda l-iskaners awtomatizzati."

msgctxt "security.category.data.label"
msgid "User data & uploads"
msgstr "Data tal-utenti u uploads"

msgctxt "security.category.data.advice"
msgid "Turn off directory listing and make sure private files require a login. A Disallow only asks polite crawlers to look away."
msgstr "Itfi l-elenkar tad-direttorji u kun żgur li l-fajls privati jeħtieġu login. Disallow titlob biss lill-crawlers edukati biex iħarsu band’oħra."

msgctxt "security.reason.admin"
msgid "Administrative interface"
msgstr "Interfaċċa amministrattiva"

msgctxt "security.reason.staging"
msgid "Non-production environment"
msgstr "Ambjent mhux tal-produzzjoni"

msgctxt "security.reason.versioned"
msgid "Versioned path, often an old or unreleased version"
msgstr "Mogħdija b’verżjoni, spiss verżjoni qadima jew mhux rilaxxata"

msgctxt "security.reason.configFile"
msgid "Configuration, version control or credential file"
msgstr "Fajl ta’ konfigurazzjoni, tal-kontroll tal-verżjonijiet jew ta’ kredenzjali"

msgctxt "security.reason.secrets"
msgid "Secrets or credentials location"
msgstr "Post ta’ sigrieti jew kredenzjali"

msgctxt "security.reason.backupDir"
msgid "Backup or database dump location"
msgstr "Post ta’ backups jew dumps tad-database"

msgctxt "security.reason.backupFile"
msgid "Backup or archive file type"
msgstr "Tip ta’ fajl ta’ backup jew arkivju"

msgctxt "security.reason.api"
msgid "Internal API or debug endpoint"
msgstr "API intern jew endpoint tad-debug"

msgctxt "security.reason.data"
msgid "User data, uploads or exports"
msgstr "Data tal-utenti, uploads jew esportazzjonijiet"

msgctxt "agents.category.search"
msgid "Search engines"
msgstr "Magni tat-tfittxija"

msgctxt "agents.category.ai-training"
msgid "AI training / LLMs"
msgstr "Taħriġ tal-AI / LLMs"

msgctxt "agents.category.ai-search"
msgid "AI search / citations"
msgstr "Tfittxija tal-AI / ċitazzjonijiet"

msgctxt "agents.category.social"
msgid "Social previews"
msgstr "Previews soċjali"

msgctxt "agents.category.seo"
msgid "SEO tools"
msgstr "Għodod tal-SEO"

msgctxt "agents.note.gptbot"
msgid "OpenAI model training."
msgstr "Taħriġ tal-mudelli ta’ OpenAI."

msgctxt "agents.note.claudebot"
msgid "Anthropic model training. Also honours the older \"anthropic-ai\" token."
msgstr "Taħriġ tal-mudelli ta’ Anthropic. Jirrispetta wkoll it-token eqdem “anthropic-ai”."

msgctxt "agents.note.googleExtended"
msgid "Control token for Gemini training. Not a crawler; Googlebot fetches the pages."
msgstr "Token ta’ kontroll għat-taħriġ ta’ Gemini. Mhux crawler; il-paġni jniżżilhom Googlebot."

msgctxt "agents.note.applebotExtended"
msgid "Control token for Apple model training. Applebot fetches the pages."
msgstr "Token ta’ kontroll għat-taħriġ tal-mudelli ta’ Apple. Il-paġni jniżżilhom Applebot."

msgctxt "agents.note.ccbot"
msgid "Common Crawl. Its archive is a major training source for many models."
msgstr "Common Crawl. L-arkivju tiegħu huwa sors ewlieni ta’ taħriġ għal ħafna mudelli."

msgctxt "agents.note.bytespider"
msgid "ByteDance / TikTok."
msgstr "ByteDance / TikTok."

msgctxt "agents.note.metaExternalagent"
msgid "Meta model training."
msgstr "Taħriġ tal-mudelli ta’ Meta."

msgctxt "agents.note.amazonbot"
msgid "Amazon, used for Alexa and model training."
msgstr "Amazon, użat għal Alexa u għat-taħriġ tal-mudelli."

msgctxt "agents.note.diffbot"
msgid "Structured-data extraction and knowledge graph."
msgstr "Estrazzjoni ta’ data strutturata u knowledge graph."

msgctxt "agents.note.cohere"
msgid "Control token for Cohere model training."
msgstr "Token ta’ kontroll għat-taħriġ tal-mudelli ta’ Cohere."

msgctxt "agents.note.omgilibot"
msgid "Webz.io, which resells crawled data for training."
msgstr "Webz.io, li jerġa’ jbigħ data miġbura bil-crawling għat-taħriġ."

msgctxt "agents.note.oaiSearchbot"
msgid "ChatGPT search index. Not used for training."
msgstr "Indiċi tat-tiftix ta’ ChatGPT. Ma jintużax għat-taħriġ."

msgctxt "agents.note.chatgptUser"
msgid "Fetches pages on a user's request inside ChatGPT."
msgstr "Iniżżel paġni fuq talba ta’ utent ġewwa ChatGPT."

msgctxt "agents.note.claudeSearchbot"
msgid "Anthropic search index. Not used for training."
msgstr "Indiċi tat-tiftix ta’ Anthropic. Ma jintużax għat-taħriġ."

msgctxt "agents.note.claudeUser"
msgid "Fetches pages on a user's request inside Claude."
msgstr "Iniżżel paġni fuq talba ta’ utent ġewwa Claude."

msgctxt "agents.note.perplexitybot"
msgid "Perplexity search index."
msgstr "Indiċi tat-tiftix ta’ Perplexity."

msgctxt "agents.note.perplexityUser"
msgid "Fetches pages on a user's request inside Perplexity."
msgstr "Iniżżel paġni fuq talba ta’ utent ġewwa Perplexity."

msgctxt "agents.note.duckassistbot"
msgid "DuckDuckGo AI answers."
msgstr "Tweġibiet tal-AI ta’ DuckDuckGo."

msgctxt "agents.note.youbot"
msgid "You.com search."
msgstr "Tiftix ta’ You.com."

msgctxt "ai.noGroup"
msgid "No matching group, so everything is allowed."
msgstr "L-ebda grupp ma jaqbel, għalhekk kollox huwa permess."

msgctxt "ai.ownGroup"
msgid "Has its own \"{token}\" group."
msgstr "Għandu l-grupp tiegħu \"{token}\"."

msgctxt "ai.starGroup"
msgid "Falls back to the \"*\" group."
msgstr "Juża l-grupp \"*\"."

msgctxt "ai.headline"
msgid "{label}: {blocked} of {total} blocked"
msgstr "{label}: {blocked} minn {total} imblukkati"

msgctxt "ai.callout.none"
msgid "No AI training crawlers are configured."
msgstr "Ma hemm l-ebda crawler tat-taħriġ tal-AI issettjat."

msgctxt "ai.callout.allBlocked"
msgid "Every known AI training crawler is blocked."
msgstr "Kull crawler magħruf tat-taħriġ tal-AI huwa imblukkat."

msgctxt "ai.callout.noneRestricted"
msgid "No AI training crawler is restricted. Content on this site may be used for model training."
msgstr "L-ebda crawler tat-taħriġ tal-AI mhu ristrett. Il-kontenut tas-sit jista' jintuża għat-taħriġ tal-mudelli."

msgctxt "ai.callout.noneNamed"
msgid "No AI training crawler is addressed by name; all of them follow the default \"*\" rules. Content may be used for model training."
msgstr "L-ebda crawler tat-taħriġ tal-AI mhu msemmi b'ismu; kollha jsegwu r-regoli awtomatiċi \"*\". Il-kontenut jista' jintuża għat-taħriġ tal-mudelli."

msgctxt "ai.callout.uneven"
msgid "AI training crawlers are treated unevenly. Still allowed or only partly restricted: {list}."
msgstr "Il-crawlers tat-taħriġ tal-AI huma ttrattati b'mod mhux ugwali. Għadhom permessi jew ristretti parzjalment biss: {list}."

msgctxt "recon.cms.kind.cms"
msgid "CMS"
msgstr "CMS"

msgctxt "recon.cms.kind.ecommerce"
msgid "E-commerce platform"
msgstr "Pjattaforma tal-e-commerce"

msgctxt "recon.cms.kind.hosting"
msgid "Hosted site builder"
msgstr "Site builder ospitat"

msgctxt "recon.cms.kind.forum"
msgid "Forum / community"
msgstr "Forum / komunità"

msgctxt "recon.cms.kind.wiki"
msgid "Wiki"
msgstr "Wiki"

msgctxt "recon.cms.kind.framework"
msgid "Front-end framework"
msgstr "Framework tal-front-end"

msgctxt "recon.cms.kind.backend"
msgid "Backend framework"
msgstr "Framework tal-backend"

msgctxt "recon.cloud.kind.storage"
msgid "Object storage"
msgstr "Ħażna ta’ oġġetti"

msgctxt "recon.cloud.kind.cdn"
msgid "CDN"
msgstr "CDN"

msgctxt "recon.cloud.kind.hosting"
msgid "Hosting"
msgstr "Hosting"

msgctxt "recon.cloud.kind.platform"
msgid "Platform CDN"
msgstr "CDN tal-pjattaforma"

msgctxt "recon.cloud.risk.storage"
msgid "Bucket and account names can be probed for public listing, read or write permissions."
msgstr "L-ismijiet tal-buckets u tal-kontijiet jistgħu jiġu ppruvati biex wieħed jara jekk għandhomx elenkar pubbliku jew permessi ta’ qari jew kitba."

msgctxt "recon.cloud.risk.cdn"
msgid "Reveals the CDN vendor and distribution or account identifier."
msgstr "Jikxef il-fornitur tas-CDN u l-identifikatur tad-distribuzzjoni jew tal-kont."

msgctxt "recon.cloud.risk.hosting"
msgid "Reveals the hosting provider and project name, often for a non-production copy."
msgstr "Jikxef il-fornitur tal-hosting u l-isem tal-proġett, spiss ta’ kopja mhux tal-produzzjoni."

msgctxt "recon.cloud.risk.platform"
msgid "Confirms the site platform and its asset store."
msgstr "Jikkonferma l-pjattaforma tas-sit u l-ħażna tal-assets tagħha."

msgctxt "recon.hosts.privateIp"
msgid "private IP"
msgstr "IP privat"

msgctxt "recon.api.kind.graphql"
msgid "GraphQL"
msgstr "GraphQL"

msgctxt "recon.api.kind.docs"
msgid "API docs & schemas"
msgstr "Dokumentazzjoni u skemi tal-API"

msgctxt "recon.api.kind.gateway"
msgid "API gateways & endpoints"
msgstr "Gateways u endpoints tal-API"

msgctxt "recon.api.kind.rpc"
msgid "RPC & realtime"
msgstr "RPC u ħin reali"

msgctxt "recon.api.kind.ops"
msgid "Health, metrics & debug"
msgstr "Health, metriċi u debug"

msgctxt "recon.api.note.graphql"
msgid "Introspection may expose the whole schema; playgrounds often lack authentication."
msgstr "L-introspection tista’ tikxef l-iskema kollha; il-playgrounds spiss ma jkollhomx awtentikazzjoni."

msgctxt "recon.api.note.docs"
msgid "Interactive docs and OpenAPI files list every endpoint and parameter."
msgstr "Id-dokumentazzjoni interattiva u l-fajls OpenAPI jelenkaw kull endpoint u kull parametru."

msgctxt "recon.api.note.gateway"
msgid "Raw entry points to test for missing authentication and rate limits."
msgstr "Punti ta’ dħul diretti li wieħed jista’ jittestja għal nuqqas ta’ awtentikazzjoni u ta’ limiti tar-rata."

msgctxt "recon.api.note.rpc"
msgid "Legacy RPC and realtime endpoints are frequent sources of unauthenticated methods."
msgstr "L-endpoints qodma tal-RPC u tal-ħin reali spiss ikollhom metodi mingħajr awtentikazzjoni."

msgctxt "recon.api.note.ops"
msgid "Operational endpoints can leak config, environment variables and internal hostnames."
